member.summary:
Returns a list of  instances that are
only held by either collection  or ;
both contains are not included in result.

Projects the specified relative cell index into absolute one;
with the specified direction as outside offset one, and an offset value 
indicating the number of advanced steps of cells.

member.param:
The shape matrix. Specify a  matrix indicating which coordinates are filled and which are not.
For example, the following pattern is for a Z piece:

new bool[,]
{
    { true, true, false },
    { false, true, true }
}
